{
  "_comment": [
    "Regression thresholds enforced by `uv run python tasks.py bench` and by the CI bench job.",
    "Latency limits are several times the numbers measured on the reference laptop, because",
    "shared runners are noisy: they catch order-of-magnitude regressions, not small drifts.",
    "Quality limits are tight, because each one is a statement the README makes: exactness is",
    "required to be exact, the secure and plaintext paths are required to agree, all three",
    "broken privacy variants are required to be flagged and neither sound variant may be.",
